# Google Maps API Key for Android (restricted to org.beanpool.pillar)
# Get a key from Google Cloud Console and paste it here
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-api-key-here

# BeanPool's key vault for this build (utils/vault.ts): its address and its public keys, pinned. Public, not secret.
# Ticket keys: 64 hex characters each; deposit keys: base64url; comma-separated, newest first. Leave all three out
# and members' sign-in copies stay at their community, exactly as before the vault; set some but not all and the build
# stops (app.config.js). Until the custodians' parts are reshared, only a TEST vault's values go here: never point a
# real build at a live vault. A vault build is also blocked until the vault signs its releases and deposit receipts,
# and global's door accepts vault tickets (V5): see PR #1336.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BEANPOOL_VAULT_URL=https://vault.example.org
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BEANPOOL_VAULT_TICKET_KEYS=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BEANPOOL_VAULT_DEPOSIT_KEYS=
